### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@courseId = {{createCourseN5.response.body.data.id}}

### ============================================================
### PRE-REQUISITE: Phải chạy 04-enrollment-flow đến bước 4.7
### (student đã enroll ACTIVE) trước khi chạy file này
### ============================================================

@lesson1Id = {{createLesson1.response.body.data.id}}
@lesson2Id = {{createLesson2.response.body.data.id}}

### ============================================================
### 5.1) Start lesson THEORY
### ============================================================
# @name startL1
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.2) Complete lesson THEORY (không score)
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.3) (EXPECTED 400) Complete lại lesson đã complete
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.4) Start lesson VOCABULARY
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.5) Complete lesson VOCABULARY
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.6) Complete MINI_TEST lần 1 với score 70
### ============================================================
# Tạo lesson MINI_TEST từ test 3.3
@lesson3Id = {{createLesson3.response.body.data.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ... (cần có lesson3 thực tế - xem 03-lesson-crud)

###
### Note: 2 lesson đã complete (lesson1 + lesson2) → progress 100% nếu course chỉ có 2 lesson
### → Enrollment tự động COMPLETED

### ============================================================
### 5.7) GET progress 1 lesson
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.8) GET toàn bộ progress trong course (kèm stats)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.9) Kiểm tra enrollment đã COMPLETED
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/me/active
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.10) (EXPECTED 400) Complete MINI_TEST không có score
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.11) Complete MINI_TEST với score 85
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": 85
}

### ============================================================
### 5.12) (EXPECTED 400) Complete lại với score thấp hơn (bestScore 85)
### → bestScore vẫn phải là 85
### ============================================================
# Lưu ý: hiện tại code reject re-complete; bestScore giữ nguyên qua lần đầu

### ============================================================
### 5.13) (EXPECTED 400) Complete THEORY với score (sai rule)
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": 50
}

### ============================================================
### 5.14) (EXPECTED 403) Complete lesson khi chưa enroll
### ============================================================
# Drop trước rồi mới complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/by-course/{{courseId}}/drop
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Sau đó:
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
